text = "I am the skull in charge of this miserable little march.\n\nSave enough skeletons by guiding them into the exit light. Pick a skill, then click a skeleton to assign it.\n\nUse A/D or the mouse wheel to pan. Space pauses. F changes march speed. R restarts. F4 opens the chamber map.\n\nWhen it pulses, click the portal to begin."

